            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "#我就开门见山地说了，你应该已经见过不少小嵴锋龙了吧，可{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}与它们都不同。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160428"
            ]
          },
          "750160428": {
            "id": "750160428",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "尾巴上的漂亮丝带！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160429"
            ]
          },
          "750160429": {
            "id": "750160429",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "哈哈，那应该是出自你的手笔吧，我要说的当然不是那个，而是它角上的印记。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160430"
            ]
          },
          "750160430": {
            "id": "750160430",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "角上的红色印记？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160431"
            ]
          },
          "750160431": {
            "id": "750160431",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "那不是一般的小龙能够拥有的印记，实际上，这在记载之中被称为「焰{RUBY#[D]修库特尔}主之祝」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160432"
            ]
          },
          "750160432": {
            "id": "750160432",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "怎么说呢，拥有这个印记的幼龙往往具备不可思议的力量，比如力气比别的龙大，有些能游得更快，或者跳得更高。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160433"
            ]
          },
          "750160433": {
            "id": "750160433",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "听上去还挺不错的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160434"
            ]
          },
          "750160434": {
            "id": "750160434",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "但是之前就说了，那是「焰主」之祝，不是它们自己的力量。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160435"
            ]
          },
          "750160435": {
            "id": "750160435",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "那是来自更远古的龙众的力量，而现在纳塔龙的身躯已无法承担那样的伟力。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160436"
            ]
          },
          "750160436": {
            "id": "750160436",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "而「大灵」和夜神之国也都排斥这样的力量，不愿意接纳它们。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160437"
            ]
          },
          "750160437": {
            "id": "750160437",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "所以在成长的过程中，它们或者会因为这力量死去，或者会因此变得失去理智，这两者都很危险。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160438"
            ]
          },
          "750160438": {
            "id": "750160438",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "或许你应该把它交给回声之子，他们会妥善处置它的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160439"
            ]
          },
          "750160439": {
            "id": "750160439",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "处置？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160440"
            ]
          },
          "750160440": {
            "id": "750160440",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "句子里有个很冰冷的词。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160441"
            ]
          },
          "750160441": {
            "id": "750160441",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "恕我嘴拙…但交给当地人是个比较好的选择。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160442"
            ]
          },
          "750160442": {
            "id": "750160442",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…谢谢你告诉我这些。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160443"
            ]
          },
          "750160443": {
            "id": "750160443",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "但是你仍然不打算放弃它，对吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160444"
            ]
          },
          "750160444": {
            "id": "750160444",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "放弃永远不是第一项的选择…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160445"
            ]
          },
          "750160445": {
            "id": "750160445",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我不会放弃自己的伙伴。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160446"
            ]
          },
          "750160446": {
            "id": "750160446",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "…唉，好吧。好吧，旅人，我已经见到你的决心了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160447"
            ]
          },
          "750160447": {
            "id": "750160447",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "我不知道是否应该告诉你，毕竟这也是纳塔「本地人」才知道的秘辛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160448"
            ]
          },
          "750160448": {
            "id": "750160448",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "#如果你要尝试拯救{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，你必须带着它踏上前往火山的朝圣路。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160449"
            ]
          },
          "750160449": {
            "id": "750160449",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "传说中，部族的勇士会带着被一分为二的信物，在大火山之中洗去了自己的伙伴被死去{RUBY#[D]修库特尔}之龙惦记的姓名。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160450"
            ]
          },
          "750160450": {
            "id": "750160450",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "然后在那里，让自己的龙重新被夜神之国接纳。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160451"
            ]
          },
          "750160451": {
            "id": "750160451",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你为什么要告诉我？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160452"
            ]
          },
          "750160452": {
            "id": "750160452",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "因为现在六大部族的人已经不会、也无暇去做这样的尝试了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160453"
            ]
          },
          "750160453": {
            "id": "750160453",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "但你不一样，你是异邦的旅人，不被部族陈旧的观念所束缚。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160454"
            ]
          },
          "750160454": {
            "id": "750160454",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "而如果你能成功，你会证明一些古物的铭刻和险些化为尘土的织卷里描述的东西直到今日仍然确凿无疑。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160455"
            ]
          },
          "750160455": {
            "id": "750160455",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "这对我很重要…如果你想进行尝试，我就为你找到那信物所在之处。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160456"
            ]
          },
          "750160456": {
            "id": "750160456",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "你也可以，救你的伙伴。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160457"
            ]
          },
          "750160457": {
            "id": "750160457",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "听上去是个双赢的局面。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160458"
            ]
          },
          "750160458": {
            "id": "750160458",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "值得一试…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160459"
            ]
          },
          "750160459": {
            "id": "750160459",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "那么…如果我找到了说好的地方，我会联系你们的。或者你们也可以来找我，我最近会在回声之子那边进行考察。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160460"
            ]
          },
          "750160460": {
            "id": "750160460",
            "speakerId": 21481,
            "speakerName": "曼科",
            "text": "再会了，朋友。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160461"
            ]
          },
          "750160461": {
            "id": "750160461",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "于是，名为曼科的龙遗物研究协会会员离开了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160462"
            ]
          },
          "750160462": {
            "id": "750160462",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#真是的，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，下次可不许乱跑了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160463"
            ]
          },
          "750160463": {
            "id": "750160463",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160464"
            ]
          },
          "750160464": {
            "id": "750160464",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#啊，对了，{NICKNAME}，刚才那个部族的人走了吗？他没说什么奇怪的话吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160465"
            ]
          },
          "750160465": {
            "id": "750160465",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "事情是这样…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160466"
            ]
          },
          "750160466": {
            "id": "750160466",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#唔…也就是说，其实{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}现在生了病，我们得带着需要带的东西去火山，帮{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}治病。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160467"
            ]
          },
          "750160467": {
            "id": "750160467",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160468"
            ]
          },
          "750160468": {
            "id": "750160468",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#唉，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}倒是一副没有听懂的样子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160469"
            ]
          },
          "750160469": {
            "id": "750160469",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不过没关系，说不定在它长大之前，我们就「刷刷刷」地把所有问题都解决了，就能让它正常健康地长大了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160470"
            ]
          },
          "750160470": {
            "id": "750160470",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#真不知道那个人靠不靠谱…反正就是找什么信物，{NICKNAME}我们也到各种地方找找看吧，说不定我们比他更早找到呢！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160471"
            ]
          },
          "750160471": {
            "id": "750160471",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160472"
            ]
          },
          "750160472": {
            "id": "750160472",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160473"
            ]
          },
          "750160473": {
            "id": "750160473",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也一起吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750160474"
            ]
          },
          "750160474": {
            "id": "750160474",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
